{
 "encounter_id": "00694",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. I'm here for the results of my cholesterol thing, I think. Or is it a new thing? I've forgotten what I booked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's the follow-up for the cholesterol, yes. Three months ago we started a statin. How have you got on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, the tablets, yes. The little white one at bedtime. Atorvastatin, 40 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how are you feeling in yourself on it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Well, my legs ache. Both thighs, mostly, since about the second week. Like I've run a marathon."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is the ache constant or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's there most days, worse on the stairs. And I'm tired, tired all the time, I've been dragging."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any headaches or stomach trouble?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few headaches, yes, in the afternoon. Nothing terrible."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any dark urine, or muscle weakness, difficulty getting out of a chair?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that. The urine's normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Aspirin, 75 mg, once a day. I thought I'd mentioned."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Codeine. It makes me throw up, terribly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. And what's your health history, besides the cholesterol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High cholesterol, that's why I'm here. And I had my gallbladder out, years ago. About 2012."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and temperature, and then examine your muscles. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 70, temperature 36.6.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal, I hope. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Normal. Now press against my hands with your legs.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good strength. Your thigh muscles aren't tender when I press them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it's not serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your strength is normal, and that's reassuring. The aches and tiredness could be a statin side effect, so I'd say statin-related muscle aches are likely."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What do I do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a blood test for muscle enzymes, called CK, and check your thyroid, because an underactive thyroid can mimic this."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I stop the tablets? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not yet, wait for the results, but if the aches become severe or your urine goes dark, stop and ring us at once."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. How will I know the results? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in a week, when they're back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week. Put it in my diary. Where's my diary? Never mind, you'll remind me. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The reception will text you. ~"
  }
 ],
